  "preprocess_markdown": "# Part One\n\n# Chapter One\n\nRegular *italic* and **bold** and ***both*** text with `code`.\nInline markers: <u>underlined</u> <span class=\"sc\">small caps</span> <code>mono</code> <span class=\"sans\">sans</span>.\n\n## A Subhead\n\n### Lower subhead\n\n> A quoted paragraph.\n>\n> Second quoted paragraph.\n\n<div class=\"scene\">* * *</div>\n\n<div class=\"block block-verse\" markdown=\"1\">\n<div class=\"block-label\">verse</div>\n\nRoses are red\nViolets are blue\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"block block-written-note\" markdown=\"1\">\n<div class=\"block-label\">written-note</div>\n\nA note written by a character.\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"scene\">* * *</div>\n\n- bullet one\n    - nested bullet\n- bullet two\n\n1. first\n2. second\n\n- [x] done task\n- [ ] open task\n\n| Name | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| a    | 1     |\n| b    | 2     |\n\n```\n# not a heading\n```\n\nA [link](https://example.com) and ![image](https://example.com/x.png).\n\nEpilogue",
  "render_markdown": "<h1>Part One</h1>\n<h1>Chapter One</h1>\n<p>Regular <em>italic</em> and <strong>bold</strong> and <strong><em>both</em></strong> text with <code>code</code>.<br>\nInline markers: <u>underlined</u> <span class=\"sc\">small caps</span> <code>mono</code> <span class=\"sans\">sans</span>.</p>\n<h2>A Subhead</h2>\n<h3>Lower subhead</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A quoted paragraph.</p>\n<p>Second quoted paragraph.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"scene\">* * *</div>\n\n<div class=\"block block-verse\">\n<div class=\"block-label\">verse</div>\n<p>Roses are red<br>\nViolets are blue</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block block-written-note\">\n<div class=\"block-label\">written-note</div>\n<p>A note written by a character.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"scene\">* * *</div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>bullet one<ul>\n<li>nested bullet</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>bullet two</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>first</li>\n<li>second</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>[x] done task</li>\n<li>[ ] open task</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre><code># not a heading\n</code></pre>\n<p>A <a href=\"https://example.com\">link</a> and <img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://example.com/x.png\">.</p>\n<p>Epilogue</p>",
  "rtf": "Hello bold world.\nCaf\u00e9 \u201cquoted\u201d \u2014 dash\nThird\ttabbed",
